1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
One newsroom. Explicit boundaries.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Research cases retain source and evidence context.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One story, independent channel variants.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Drafts remain separate from provider execution.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Human review is tied to the exact revision.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Plan editorial work without a live publication.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Preflight exposes blocked or pending conditions.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Tenant-scoped access and explicit team roles.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Track work through a governed control plane.
